  "details": "The toggle of the three functions \"Mask Remote Users\", \"Mask World\", and \" Mask UI\" are reversed. When turned \"On\", instead of masking the elements, it shows the elements, and vice versa. This discrepancy probably originated from the strings and behaviours being directly copied from MM, where the toggle doesn't have \"On\" or \"Off\" overlayed on them.\n\nDiscussion in Discord:\n\nhttps://discord.com/channels/1096246414603997194/1154207112176607275/1214774921130020876\n\nCredit: sdruuba aka. ʙɪɢ․",
